# SCPN ICF Beam Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN ICF Beam Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for ion-beam and pulsed-electron-beam
  inertial confinement fusion configurations within the SCPN Reactor
  Systems Research Group. Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a
  validated device configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics
  aligned with the SCPN Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0
  device physics (the illumination geometry a particle-beam driver puts on
  a target, the mass inventory of a layered capsule, and the chain of
  efficiencies from beam to fusion energy), and tessellated and B-rep
  models of the layered capsule. All parameter sets are synthetic or
  anchored on freely published preprints; no real machine is described,
  and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
